// Hand-placed landmarks. "chunk" is [x, z] in 64 m chunk coordinates;
// the coast road runs along chunk column x = 3 (beach), ocean beyond, a canal
// crosses the city along chunk row z = 4 and the docks are at x = 3, z <= -4.
// Types: safehouse, tower, grand_hotel, lighthouse, park, police_station,
// hospital, dealership. "district" optionally overrides the procedural
// district (park, downtown, residential). "marker" / "respawn" are
// chunk-local [x, z] positions used by gameplay (interaction point, where
// players reappear).
